>greet_prog 100~
if ispc($n)
  mpechoat $n The Spinner smiles at you as though she has known you since the day you were born.  Perhaps she has.
  say Oh, I remember your thread!  Such a pretty color.  Do sit, if you like.  I never stop, but I do enjoy the company.
endif
